IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P4-gate`
IMPORT `P4-art-37-39`

-- Tests of Articles 37 to 39 (consolidated lines 622-635). Expected values are written from the text.
-- Each gated function: a case before (1 August 2025), on (2 August 2025) and after the date Chapter III Section 4 applies.

§ `Article 37`

-- args: date asked, reasons to doubt, an investigation is necessary, the Commission has investigated
#ASSERT `Art 37(1) the Commission has investigated the case` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 37(1) the Commission has investigated the case` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 37(1) the Commission has investigated the case` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 37(1) the Commission has investigated the case` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 37(1) the Commission has investigated the case` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 37(1) the Commission has investigated the case` (Date 1 12 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 37(1) the duty of the Commission to investigate` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 37 Commission` DOES `Art 37(1) investigate the cases where there are reasons to doubt the competence of a notified body` AT 30
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 37(1) the duty of the Commission to investigate` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- args: date asked, the Commission has requested the information, the authority has provided it
#ASSERT `Art 37(2) the notifying authority has provided the Commission with the information on request` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 37(2) the notifying authority has provided the Commission with the information on request` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 37(2) the notifying authority has provided the Commission with the information on request` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 37(2) the notifying authority has provided the Commission with the information on request` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 37(2) the duty of the notifying authority to provide the Commission with the information on request` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 37 notifying authority` DOES `Art 37(2) provide the Commission, on request, with all relevant information` AT 10
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 37(2) the duty of the notifying authority to provide the Commission with the information on request` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- args: date asked, the Commission treats the sensitive information confidentially in accordance with Article 78
#ASSERT `Art 37(3) the Commission has treated the sensitive information confidentially` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 37(3) the Commission has treated the sensitive information confidentially` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 37(3) the Commission has treated the sensitive information confidentially` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 37(3) the duty of the Commission to treat the sensitive information confidentially` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 37 Commission` DOES `Art 37(3) treat the sensitive information obtained in the course of its investigations confidentially` AT 1
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 37(3) the duty of the Commission to treat the sensitive information confidentially` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- args: date asked, the Commission ascertains the body does not meet the requirements, it informed the Member State and requested corrective measures
#ASSERT `Art 37(4) first sentence the Commission has informed the notifying Member State and requested the corrective measures` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 37(4) first sentence the Commission has informed the notifying Member State and requested the corrective measures` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 37(4) first sentence the Commission has informed the notifying Member State and requested the corrective measures` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 37(4) first sentence the Commission has informed the notifying Member State and requested the corrective measures` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 37(4) the duty of the Commission to inform the notifying Member State and request the corrective measures` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 37 Commission` DOES `Art 37(4) inform the notifying Member State and request it to take the necessary corrective measures` AT 5
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 37(4) the duty of the Commission to inform the notifying Member State and request the corrective measures` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- The power: args: date asked, the Commission ascertains the failure, it informed the Member State and requested measures, the Member State fails to take them
#ASSERT `Art 37(4) second sentence the Commission may suspend, restrict or withdraw the designation by means of an implementing act` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 37(4) second sentence the Commission may suspend, restrict or withdraw the designation by means of an implementing act` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 37(4) second sentence the Commission may suspend, restrict or withdraw the designation by means of an implementing act` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 37(4) second sentence the Commission may suspend, restrict or withdraw the designation by means of an implementing act` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 37(4) second sentence the Commission may suspend, restrict or withdraw the designation by means of an implementing act` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: date asked, the implementing act was adopted in accordance with the examination procedure of Article 98(2)
#ASSERT `Art 37(4) third sentence the implementing act has been adopted in accordance with the examination procedure` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 37(4) third sentence the implementing act has been adopted in accordance with the examination procedure` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 37(4) third sentence the implementing act has been adopted in accordance with the examination procedure` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 38`

-- args: date asked, coordination and cooperation are in place and properly operated, in the form of a sectoral group
#ASSERT `Art 38(1) the Commission has ensured the coordination and cooperation between notified bodies` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 38(1) the Commission has ensured the coordination and cooperation between notified bodies` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 38(1) the Commission has ensured the coordination and cooperation between notified bodies` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 38(1) the Commission has ensured the coordination and cooperation between notified bodies` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 38(1) the duty of the Commission to ensure the coordination and cooperation` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 38 Commission` DOES `Art 38(1) put in place and properly operate coordination and cooperation in the form of a sectoral group` AT 90
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 38(1) the duty of the Commission to ensure the coordination and cooperation` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- args: date asked, the bodies notified participate directly, they participate through designated representatives
#ASSERT `Art 38(2) the notifying authority has ensured that the bodies notified by it participate in the work of the group` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 38(2) the notifying authority has ensured that the bodies notified by it participate in the work of the group` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 38(2) the notifying authority has ensured that the bodies notified by it participate in the work of the group` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 38(2) the notifying authority has ensured that the bodies notified by it participate in the work of the group` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 38(2) the duty of the notifying authority to ensure that the notified bodies participate` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 38 notifying authority` DOES `Art 38(2) ensure that the bodies notified by it participate in the work of the group` AT 5
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 38(2) the duty of the notifying authority to ensure that the notified bodies participate` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- args: date asked, the Commission has provided for the exchange
#ASSERT `Art 38(3) the Commission has provided for the exchange of knowledge and best practices` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 38(3) the Commission has provided for the exchange of knowledge and best practices` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 38(3) the Commission has provided for the exchange of knowledge and best practices` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 38(3) the duty of the Commission to provide for the exchange of knowledge and best practices` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 38 Commission` DOES `Art 38(3) provide for the exchange of knowledge and best practices between notifying authorities` AT 5
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 38(3) the duty of the Commission to provide for the exchange of knowledge and best practices` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400

§ `Article 39`

