#ASSERT `Art 39 the conformity assessment body of a third country may be authorised to carry out the activities of notified bodies` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 39 the conformity assessment body of a third country may be authorised to carry out the activities of notified bodies` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 39 the conformity assessment body of a third country may be authorised to carry out the activities of notified bodies` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
